meta {
  name: Get Last Fuel
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/fuel/last
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get Last Fuel

  This request is used to get last fuel purchase history. This request interacts with the MySQL database, and has a protected routes.

  ## Responses

  **200 — Fuel record fetched successfully**
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "fuel fetched",
    "data": {
      "id": "6f59235e-c398-8a83-2f95-3f1fbe95ca6e",
      "vehicle_plate_number": "B 1234 CD",
      "vehicle_type": "City Car",
      "fuel_volume": 45.5,
      "fuel_price_total": 325000,
      "fuel_brand": "Pertamina",
      "fuel_type": "Pertamax",
      "fuel_ron": 92,
      "created_at": "2024-09-20 22:53:47",
      "fuel_bill": "https://example.com/uploads/fuel_bills/bill123.jpg"
    }
  }
```

  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
```

  **404 — fuel failed to fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "fuel not found"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}